02:19:53,700 --> 02:19:55,620
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: It was loaned to land bank.

2366
02:19:55,620 --> 02:19:59,800
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And then, there was a loan of about 8,000,000.

2367
02:19:59,800 --> 02:20:03,580
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And then, the owner cannot be seen anymore.

2368
02:20:03,580 --> 02:20:08,320
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And so, therefore, I brought the officers on my own expense to land bank.

2369
02:20:08,540 --> 02:20:10,900
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: They said that,

2370
02:20:10,900 --> 02:20:17,100
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: once the redemption period ends, which is September, then we can already bid for that.

2371
02:20:17,300 --> 02:20:21,480
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: But then, I said, the best way, we don't have the money for the entire amount.

2372
02:20:21,480 --> 02:20:23,380
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, therefore, they can contribute.

2373
02:20:23,380 --> 02:20:27,500
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, we want the SHAPC to buy the property.

2374
02:20:27,500 --> 02:20:30,500
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And we will be paying you 25 years to pay.

2375
02:20:30,680 --> 02:20:31,660
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Would that be okay?

2376
02:20:31,800 --> 02:20:33,700
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Our good President Laksa here?

2377
02:20:34,300 --> 02:20:39,360
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: That will be under the ECMP, Madam Chair.

2378
02:20:40,080 --> 02:20:40,720
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Yes.

2379
02:20:40,720 --> 02:20:48,580
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: We will be waiting for the proposal from the Homeowners Association or Community Association.

2380
02:20:48,580 --> 02:20:50,220
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I will be bringing them here.

2381
02:20:50,220 --> 02:20:51,420
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Yes.

2382
02:20:51,420 --> 02:20:53,540
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: To be able to talk to you, Your Honor.

2383
02:20:53,540 --> 02:20:54,560
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Yes.

2384
02:20:54,560 --> 02:20:55,420
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So that we can be able.

2385
02:20:55,420 --> 02:20:58,440
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The redemption time will end.

2386
02:20:58,520 --> 02:21:09,460
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: The one-year redemption period of the bank extrajudicial mortgage will be on September 5.

2387
02:21:09,460 --> 02:21:11,620
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, after that, we come to you.

2388
02:21:11,620 --> 02:21:12,560
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Please help us.

2389
02:21:12,560 --> 02:21:17,920
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: We're increasing your budget by 4 billion to be able to buy the property.

2390
02:21:18,380 --> 02:21:21,720
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And they will pay you over 25 years, is it?

2391
02:21:21,720 --> 02:21:22,440
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Imagine that.

2392
02:21:22,440 --> 02:21:23,520
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: What a big help.

2393
02:21:23,520 --> 02:21:24,080
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: That's why you have to be financed.

2394
02:21:24,260 --> 02:21:25,400
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Yes.

2395
02:21:25,400 --> 02:21:28,620
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Can we hear the response of the President of the SHAPC?

2396
02:21:28,620 --> 02:21:30,420
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: Yes, Madam Chair.

2397
02:21:30,420 --> 02:21:36,700
SHFC President and CEO Federico A. Laxa: We will be happy to help you in that respect under the Enhanced Community Mortgage Program.

2398
02:21:37,700 --> 02:21:39,520
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: You see?

2399
02:21:39,520 --> 02:21:41,700
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Very correct answers from the President.

2400
02:21:41,720 --> 02:21:43,480
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: So, therefore, Madam Chair.

2401
02:21:43,480 --> 02:21:43,800
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Madam Chair.

2402
02:21:44,020 --> 02:21:46,180
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Chair.

2403
02:21:46,960 --> 02:21:47,343
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Yes.

2404
02:21:47,562 --> 02:21:48,035
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: You're recognized.

2405
02:21:48,153 --> 02:21:50,640
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you for recognizing me.

2406
02:21:50,840 --> 02:21:51,160
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Vice Chair.

2407
02:21:51,160 --> 02:21:58,040
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Madam Chair, in the proper time, I will move not only for the approval of the budget of

2408
02:21:58,040 --> 02:22:04,800
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: DSOD and its agency, but move to increase the budget as requested by the DSOD and the

2409
02:22:04,800 --> 02:22:05,540
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: attached agencies.

2410
02:22:06,780 --> 02:22:07,540
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Tingnan mo?

2411
02:22:07,620 --> 02:22:08,700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Lakpak tayo lahat.

2412
02:22:08,700 --> 02:22:09,880
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you.

2413
02:22:09,880 --> 02:22:10,520
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you, SHAPC.

2414
02:22:10,520 --> 02:22:11,580
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: We will meet you.

2415
02:22:11,580 --> 02:22:12,920
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: I'll bring the officers.

2416
02:22:12,920 --> 02:22:13,740
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you so much.

2417
02:22:13,740 --> 02:22:15,320
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: The astute.

2418
02:22:15,500 --> 02:22:18,400
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: And also, Joven, please always continue.

2419
02:22:18,400 --> 02:22:21,760
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: When once you have the 1 million, please give as always.

2420
02:22:21,960 --> 02:22:22,340
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you.

2421
02:22:23,240 --> 02:22:24,860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: There are 5 more, ha?

2422
02:22:24,860 --> 02:22:25,560
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: 4 more pa.

2423
02:22:25,620 --> 02:22:26,140
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you.

2424
02:22:28,480 --> 02:22:34,080
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Vice Chair, the astute Congressman, Vice Chair Rufus Rodriguez.

2425
02:22:34,080 --> 02:22:36,900
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: I've known him when I was only like 18 years old.

2426
02:22:37,000 --> 02:22:38,000
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: But now.

2427
02:22:38,100 --> 02:22:46,980
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Whenever you're around, you always motivate us, encourage us to do more, to be the best

2428
02:22:46,980 --> 02:22:47,700
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: version of ourselves.

2429
02:22:48,020 --> 02:22:48,860
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you so much.

2430
02:22:49,200 --> 02:22:55,280
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Next to interpret, Congresswoman Maria Isabel Segarra.

2431
02:22:55,480 --> 02:22:56,260
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: You're recognized.

2432
02:22:57,600 --> 02:22:58,780
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Thank you, Madam Chair.

2433
02:22:59,080 --> 02:23:00,400
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Mayong hapon sa tanan.

2434
02:23:01,040 --> 02:23:02,800
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Kung Rufus, where are you?

2435
02:23:04,260 --> 02:23:04,820
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Okay.

2436
02:23:04,960 --> 02:23:06,940
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: I believe that among the members that are here this afternoon.

2437
02:23:06,940 --> 02:23:11,420
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: I have the strongest vote to support for an additional budget.

2438
02:23:12,180 --> 02:23:14,420
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: But sana, papunta sa amin, ha?

2439
02:23:14,600 --> 02:23:17,500
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: I belong to NIR region.

2440
02:23:17,760 --> 02:23:24,640
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: And apparently, we have the lowest budget with an amount of only 9.4 million.

2441
02:23:25,680 --> 02:23:29,780
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: And which I don't think, this is even enough for the staffing of personnel.

2442
02:23:30,580 --> 02:23:31,980
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: I support the budget.

2443
02:23:32,180 --> 02:23:33,660
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: That's what I've said.

2444
02:23:33,880 --> 02:23:36,980
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: And you know, Ilocos region is the next.

2445
02:23:36,980 --> 02:23:41,560
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Ilocos region is the next figure that I see with a difference of 45 million.

2446
02:23:41,560 --> 02:23:48,900
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: So sana, bisan at par na lang maging 45, 55, no?

2447
02:23:49,140 --> 02:23:50,660
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Kawawa naman our region.

2448
02:23:51,100 --> 02:23:55,940
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: So I hope you'll also be able to give our region, especially the second district of

2449
02:23:55,940 --> 02:24:02,440
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: which is mine, or the province of Negros Oriental, a thought on how to serve better our constituents

2450
02:24:02,440 --> 02:24:04,200
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: on the housing issues.

2451
02:24:05,180 --> 02:24:10,040
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Anyway, aside from that, do we have any intervention when houses of indigent constituents

2452
02:24:10,040 --> 02:24:12,700
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: are totally damaged by fire?

2453
02:24:13,040 --> 02:24:14,480
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: How do we go about it?

2454
02:24:15,380 --> 02:24:21,960
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: And because you know why, before their houses are being consumed by the fire, they don't

2455
02:24:21,960 --> 02:24:23,540
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: do any rental or whatever.

2456
02:24:23,840 --> 02:24:28,600
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: And suddenly, when there's a fire that consumes their houses, they, of course, there's nowhere

2457
02:24:28,600 --> 02:24:32,380
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: to go but to do the, they will be renting.

2458
02:24:32,380 --> 02:24:40,300
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: So I hope we will be able to do something that, parang maka, they will be able to build

2459
02:24:40,300 --> 02:24:42,860
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: even just a modest house.

2460
02:24:43,500 --> 02:24:44,160
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Thank you.

2461
02:24:44,980 --> 02:24:46,520
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: May I reply, Madam Chair?

2462
02:24:48,040 --> 02:24:49,240
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Please, Mr. Secretary.

2463
02:24:49,240 --> 02:24:49,480
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Thank you.

2464
02:24:49,480 --> 02:24:53,480
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: So, dun po sa mga nasusunugan, meron po tayong programa dyan.

2465
02:24:54,460 --> 02:24:56,400
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Unang-una, meron tayo yung IDSAP.

2466
02:24:56,940 --> 02:24:59,640
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Pwede po sila mag-advail ng IDSAP and EHAP.

2467
02:24:59,640 --> 02:25:00,860
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Second is the...

2468
02:25:00,860 --> 02:25:03,780
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Nagbibigay po tayo ng mga construction materials.

2469
02:25:04,740 --> 02:25:08,760
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: Third, meron po tayong mga shelter repair kits.

2470
02:25:09,100 --> 02:25:14,160
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: And then dadagdagan pa po natin, kung meron pong available na lupa ang LGU na pwedeng

2471
02:25:14,160 --> 02:25:19,700
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: lagyan ng mga modular houses as temporary housing nila habang ginagawa yung mga bahay

2472
02:25:19,700 --> 02:25:25,820
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: nila, then we can extend those assistance sa inyo po.

2473
02:25:27,240 --> 02:25:29,980
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Secretary, actually, thank you so much for that.

2474
02:25:30,880 --> 02:25:37,220
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Talking about if we have the lot, actually, I'm the wife of Mayor Chigiting

2475
02:25:37,360 --> 02:25:45,320
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: and we were able to send letter to your office concerning the collaboration of the Landmaster and the LGU.

2476
02:25:45,720 --> 02:25:48,880
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: I hope pwede na ito ma-approve.

2477
02:25:49,660 --> 02:25:50,720
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Thank you so much.

2478
02:25:50,920 --> 02:25:53,160
DHSUD Secretary Jose Ramon P. Aliling: We'll look into that, Madam Chair.

2479
02:25:53,500 --> 02:25:54,600
Rep. Ma. Isabel L. Sagarbarria: Thank you.

2480
02:25:54,700 --> 02:25:56,640
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you so much, Secretary.

2481
02:26:07,160 --> 02:26:16,480
Rep. Julienne "Jam" L. Baronda: Thank you. [unclear] Next [unclear], Congressman Miro Quimbo.

2482
02:26:18,580 --> 02:26:24,900
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Maraming salamat, Chairman, to the entire housing family, to the key shelter agencies.

2483
02:26:25,760 --> 02:26:28,020
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Magandang hapon po sa inyong lahat.

2484
02:26:29,860 --> 02:26:35,880
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Marami sana akong tanong pero hiyo ako na masyadong magtanong dahil mukhang buong araw na kayong nabubugbog dito.

2485
02:26:37,000 --> 02:26:41,340
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: At bilang dating kasama din po sa pamilya ng mga KSA,

2486
02:26:41,360 --> 02:26:44,400
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: pareho namang po issue eh.

2487
02:26:44,460 --> 02:26:51,760
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, practically, yung IHAP na yan, yan din po isang bagay na nagkaroon kami ng maling akala.

2488
02:26:52,600 --> 02:26:57,900
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, naipangako namin sa mga tao at it turns out na wala palang pondo.

2489
02:26:59,360 --> 02:27:02,840
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, sisiguraduhin namin magiging bahagi kami na mapondohan nito.

2490
02:27:03,540 --> 02:27:09,320
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: At sana'y yung aming mga nakapila na ho dyan sa mariki ng mga nasunugan,

2491
02:27:09,320 --> 02:27:13,740
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: ay kukunti lang naman yung sekretary, GM eh, yung sa amin.

2492
02:27:13,880 --> 02:27:20,200
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, baka sana mapagbigyan sa once the funding is actually available.

2493
02:27:20,580 --> 02:27:23,900
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Because, really, when you look at the DBM, there's major underspending.

2494
02:27:25,200 --> 02:27:30,540
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, I checked when we had the first meeting with the DBM, they said that there's no underspending,

2495
02:27:30,540 --> 02:27:35,840
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: but a closer evaluation has shown that there is underspending.

2496
02:27:36,060 --> 02:27:40,360
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: And, you know, housing, as I always say, is the biggest multiplier talaga.

2497
02:27:40,500 --> 02:27:43,620
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Ayun, paulit-ulit tayo dyan sa mga ginagawa natin.

2498
02:27:43,680 --> 02:27:45,840
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Yan ang natutunan ko sa pag-ibig. Natutuwa ko.

2499
02:27:46,540 --> 02:27:57,020
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Madam Chair, itong si CEO Malin Acosta, nung nasa pag-ibig ako, siya ang aming manager ng San Fernando branch.

2500
02:27:58,180 --> 02:28:04,000
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Itim na itim pa ang buhok lahat niyan, ano ha? Ngayon, parang wala na natira, ha?

2501
02:28:04,000 --> 02:28:09,000
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, I'm happy.

2502
02:28:09,000 --> 02:28:15,580
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: And, Secretary, that the fund continues to perform and carry out the same culture that I inherited and that I also left.

2503
02:28:16,500 --> 02:28:18,400
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, nakakatuwa po.

2504
02:28:18,400 --> 02:28:26,140
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Pero, panguli ko na lang, itong ating CMP program sa ilalim ng Social Housing Finance Corporation, hindi ako sanay magbigay ng papuri eh.

2505
02:28:26,840 --> 02:28:35,460
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Kasi, pero talagang si GM Rico ay, ah, President pala.

2506
02:28:35,460 --> 02:28:38,360
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Nasanay kasi akong GM eh, nung nasa NHA.

2507
02:28:38,360 --> 02:28:44,700
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: No, but genuinely, I think Rico represents a bureaucrat who is able to find solutions.

2508
02:28:45,680 --> 02:28:49,360
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Wala, wala. Walang pag may problema, parating may sagot.

2509
02:28:49,360 --> 02:28:53,660
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Imbis na balakid, o itong problema, etc. lahat.

2510
02:28:53,660 --> 02:28:58,800
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Kulang na lang pag sinabi ko, ito, wala ka bang ibabahay? Wala na eh. Ah, hindi, bahay pa rin natin.

2511
02:28:59,360 --> 02:29:03,000
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Hindi naman, nagbibiro ako. But, even in terms of...

2512
02:29:04,580 --> 02:29:10,960
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Ah, kasi maraming kabit-kabit po eh, na usapin, na related din po sa HUDC, or sorry, sa DSUD.

2513
02:29:12,320 --> 02:29:19,280
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, nagpapasalamat ako kay CEO Laksa na wala kaming nilapit sa kanya at lahat po yan ay mga CMP.

2514
02:29:19,700 --> 02:29:23,440
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, wala pong kalokohan dyan, walang pinagkakakitaan, kung ano man po yan.

2515
02:29:23,440 --> 02:29:30,980
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Yan po ay talagang serbisyo lang na matagal nang inaasam-asam ng ating mga kababayan.

2516
02:29:31,080 --> 02:29:37,900
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, I hope, I'm not a senior member of the Committee on Appropriation, but I'll be the first one to say,

2517
02:29:37,900 --> 02:29:48,040
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: ang campaign na magkaroon ng pondo talaga ang ating CMP program, dahil ito talaga ang pinaka-emancipating program sa buong DSUD.

2518
02:29:48,040 --> 02:29:51,780
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, salamat po sa lahat ng suporta.

2519
02:29:51,780 --> 02:29:56,100
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: At saka yung marami pa po kami re-rehistro ng mga ho-wa.

2520
02:29:56,100 --> 02:29:59,580
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Ganyan lang naman po, mababaw lang po ang aming mga pangailangan.

2521
02:29:59,580 --> 02:30:03,420
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Pero ang sinisigurado po namin ay we want to support.

2522
02:30:03,420 --> 02:30:09,900
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: We encourage them to register, to regularize, so that they are protected also under the law.

2523
02:30:09,900 --> 02:30:15,520
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: At mabait po yung inyong regional director, nakausap ko rin po, na inaasikaso.

2524
02:30:15,520 --> 02:30:17,320
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Asan ba yung ating regional director na NCR?

2525
02:30:18,040 --> 02:30:20,520
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Ah, wala dito? Ah, baka bising-bising tatrabawan, no?

2526
02:30:21,940 --> 02:30:27,000
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: So, pag iniimbita po namin siya, sekretary, para pumunta po sa city mismo, para ipaliwanag, ano yung mga requirements.

2527
02:30:27,160 --> 02:30:32,180
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Kasi marami sa ating mga kababayan talaga niloloko eh.

2528
02:30:32,260 --> 02:30:35,240
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Bising-bising po, may event sa Marikina raw sa Thursday.

2529
02:30:35,280 --> 02:30:40,600
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Ah, yun. Yung pinaka-importante. Importante, imbitado ako dyan, sekretary, diba?

2530
02:30:41,460 --> 02:30:46,500
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: Madalas kasi di na ako na-iimbita eh, pero parang this time na-iimbita ako. Maraming salamat po ulit dyan.

2531
02:30:46,500 --> 02:30:48,000
Rep. Atty. Miro S. Quimbo: No, but seriously, many LGUs...

